    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a predictive model for residential property theft/larceny rates for a specific ZIP code. I have some new census data showing a pretty significant shift in the ethnic composition of the neighborhood over the last 5 years. If i run a regression model, should i include these demographic shifts as a primary variable to see if they correlate with the rise in theft reports?",
